<title>KENYA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 371-9 V SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 371-9 V SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan scored 371 for nine (50 overs) in their four nations match against Sri Lanka on Friday.</p>
